  <entry>
    <title>Hello World</title>
    <link href="/2026/08/06/hello-world/"/>
    <url>/2026/08/06/hello-world/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Welcome to <a href="https://hexo.io/">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href="https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues">GitHub</a>.</p><h2 id="Quick-Start"><a href="#Quick-Start" class="headerlink" title="Quick Start"></a>Quick Start</h2><h3 id="Create-a-new-post"><a href="#Create-a-new-post" class="headerlink" title="Create a new post"></a>Create a new post</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">$ hexo new <span class="hljs-string">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html">Writing</a></p><h3 id="Run-server"><a href="#Run-server" class="headerlink" title="Run server"></a>Run server</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">$ hexo server<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/server.html">Server</a></p><h3 id="Generate-static-files"><a href="#Generate-static-files" class="headerlink" title="Generate static files"></a>Generate static files</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">$ hexo generate<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html">Generating</a></p><h3 id="Deploy-to-remote-sites"><a href="#Deploy-to-remote-sites" class="headerlink" title="Deploy to remote sites"></a>Deploy to remote sites</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">$ hexo deploy<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html">Deployment</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>青龙面板安装ninja，DIY-ninja界面</title>
    <link href="/2022/08/02/%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85ninja%EF%BC%8CDIY-ninja%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2/"/>
    <url>/2022/08/02/%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85ninja%EF%BC%8CDIY-ninja%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="🚦个人安装ninja备忘录🚦"><a href="#🚦个人安装ninja备忘录🚦" class="headerlink" title="🚦个人安装ninja备忘录🚦"></a><strong>🚦个人安装ninja备忘录🚦</strong></h2><p>虽然ninja扫码登录已成过去式，凉了，但是可以DIY ninja 界面，粘贴ck提交到青龙面板</p><h1 id="一，安装ninja"><a href="#一，安装ninja" class="headerlink" title="一，安装ninja"></a>一，安装ninja</h1><p>1，首先进入青龙容器，qinglong 为容器名称，根据自己的填</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker <span class="hljs-built_in">exec</span> -it qinglong bash<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>2，拉取ninja</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">git <span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/MoonBegonia/ninja.git /ql/ninja<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/6a330d1f36444a379ea90d36b101d299.png#pic_center"><br>3，进入ninja后端文件夹</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> /ql/ninja/backend<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>4，安装ninja</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">pnpm install<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/95e71918b21b4ccb872cf7c2ca4395fe.png#pic_center"></p><p>5，启动ninja</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">pm2 start<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/5010fb2bbefb4a4698e969c8b338df15.png#pic_center"><br>6，添加随青龙启动自启，在宝塔  &#x2F;root&#x2F;ql&#x2F;config 目录下的 extra.sh 添加下面代码</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> /ql/ninja/backend<br>pm2 start<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/77e888eb7d2b4623bbe39dc6a789d4e0.png#pic_center"></p><p>至此 ninja 安装完成，浏览器进网址：<a href="http://ip:5701/">http://ip:5701</a></p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/f597b2a22a4a46538f345b08ab813a45.png#pic_center"></p><h1 id="二、DIY-ninja界面"><a href="#二、DIY-ninja界面" class="headerlink" title="二、DIY ninja界面"></a>二、DIY ninja界面</h1><p>1，开启ninja隐藏的输入ck栏</p><p>1.1首先进入青龙容器</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker <span class="hljs-built_in">exec</span> -it qinglong bash<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>1.2，输入下面代码</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">sed -i <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;/&lt;body&gt;/a\&lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;\nwindow.onload=function()&#123;\ndocument.getElementsByClassName(&quot;card hidden&quot;)[0].className = &quot;card&quot;;\n&#125;\n&lt;/script&gt;&#x27;</span> $(find /ql -<span class="hljs-built_in">type</span> f -name <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;*.html&#x27;</span>| xargs grep -l -r <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;modulepreload&#x27;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/8f4a4280043c46789c97f8848f79fe20.png#pic_center"><br>1.3，重启容器，刷新一下就看到隐藏的界面了</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker restart qinglong<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/861ba662f56f4eaaaf71e0640a77c655.png#pic_center"><br>2，修改公告栏</p><p>2.1，打开宝塔 &#x2F;root&#x2F;ql&#x2F;ninja&#x2F;backend&#x2F;static 目录下的 index.html ，里面内容全部删除，复制下面代码进去，自行DIY</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br>&lt;html lang=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;zh&quot;</span>&gt;<br>  &lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">head</span>&gt;<br>    &lt;meta charset=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span> /&gt;<br>    &lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">link</span> rel=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;icon&quot;</span> href=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/favicon.ico&quot;</span> /&gt;<br>    &lt;meta name=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;viewport&quot;</span> content=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;</span> /&gt;<br>    &lt;title&gt;我是标题&lt;/title&gt;<br>    &lt;script <span class="hljs-built_in">type</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;module&quot;</span> crossorigin src=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/assets/index.1a8beb0e.js&quot;</span>&gt;&lt;/script&gt;<br>    &lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">link</span> rel=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;modulepreload&quot;</span> href=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/assets/vendor.baa403e4.js&quot;</span>&gt;<br>    &lt;<span class="hljs-built_in">link</span> rel=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> href=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/assets/index.fcdd9895.css&quot;</span>&gt;<br>  &lt;/head&gt;<br>  &lt;body&gt;<br>&lt;script <span class="hljs-built_in">type</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;text/javascript&quot;</span>&gt;<br>window.onload=<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">function</span></span>()&#123;<br>document.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;card hidden&quot;</span>)[0].className = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;card&quot;</span>;<br>&#125;<br>&lt;/script&gt;<br>    &lt;div <span class="hljs-built_in">id</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;app&quot;</span>&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<br>    <br>  &lt;/body&gt;<br>&lt;/html&gt;<br>&lt;script <span class="hljs-built_in">type</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;text/javascript&quot;</span>&gt;<br>window.onload=<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">function</span></span> ()&#123;<br>        var x = document.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;card-title&quot;</span>);x[0].innerHTML=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;温馨提示&quot;</span>;<br>        var b = document.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;card-body text-base leading-6&quot;</span>);b[0].innerHTML=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&lt;p&gt;建议关闭免密支付以及打开支付验密（京东-设置-支付设置-支付验密设置）&quot;</span><br>        var k = document.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;card-body text-base leading-6&quot;</span>)[0];<br>        k.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;waikiki&quot;</span>).href=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;https://github.com/Waikkii/JD_Get_Cookie&quot;</span><br>        k.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;jd&quot;</span>).href=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;https://m.jd.com/&quot;</span><br>        k.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;getcookie&quot;</span>).href=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;https://www.icloud.com/shortcuts/f0bf8b56bd0949afabfc00ca6fbfb4c2&quot;</span><br>        var d = document.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;card hidden&quot;</span>);d[0].className = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;card&#x27;</span><br>        var c = document.getElementsByClassName(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;card&quot;</span>);c[1].className = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;card hidden&#x27;</span><br>&#125;<br>&lt;/script&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/e31df77bd1014061bd6ef91f0174b927.png#pic_center"><br>2.2，修改余量及端口，打开宝塔 &#x2F;root&#x2F;ql&#x2F;ninja&#x2F;backend 目录下的 .env.example 自行修改</p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/1c7585ea88034946824575ce2860281e.png#pic_center"></p><p>2.3，提交 ck 登录到青龙面板</p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/071d4a4098bf4c7aaae2e72bf866cdfd.png#pic_center"></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
