  <entry>
    <title>青龙面板搭建教</title>
    <link href="/2022/07/31/%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/"/>
    <url>/2022/07/31/%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>搭建青龙面板首先有个服务器，推荐腾讯云、阿里云，VM虚拟机也可以搭建</strong></p><p><strong>1.系统选择： centos7.6</strong></p><p>以腾讯云为例，先选地区、然后选择官方镜像、系统镜像、Centos7.6版本</p><p>密码请自行设置。</p><p><strong>2. SSH远程服务器管理工具：FinalShell</strong></p><p> 软件地址：<a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1FGmNLYV38sKa_D_yDMNaEg?pwd=xhct">FinalShell3.9.5.7免安装版</a></p><p> 打开FinalShell，如图所示，填上服务器IP，用户名root，密码。<br> <img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/a4cbb382c7754df29ff3ab0ce0fadb01.png#pic_center"><br> 填好之后选择服务器进行连接，连接成功如下图</p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/ab132cd6ceab4f2b827a89fb1c0a6d7c.png#pic_center" alt="在这里插入图片描述"></p><p><strong>3、安装宝塔</strong><br>一键安装代码如下：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">yum install -y wget &amp;&amp; wget -O install.sh http://download.bt.cn/install/install_6.0.sh &amp;&amp; sh install.sh<br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p> 回复：y    等待它自己安装完成即可，成功如图：<br> <img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/3d6290ffb6774828a10926c97411abfb.png#pic_center"><br>复制上面的外网面板地址——下面的password，然后浏览器输入外网面板地址，登陆用户名和密码就是下面的username、password</p><p>如果访问进不去，放行下8888端口</p><p><strong>4、登录宝塔面板，安装docker</strong></p><p>登陆宝塔之后，绑定宝塔账号可以自己注册个宝塔账号进行绑定</p><p>会给你推荐安装的，直接×掉就行</p><p>然后左侧软件商店，搜索 docker  安装，先喝杯茶等一会</p><p>等待完成，安装完成后回到ssh连接工具开始搭建青龙<br><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/5be428e0fc8447ac87df847e23f04188.png#pic_center"><br><strong>5. 搭建青龙面板</strong></p><p>单容器青龙面板搭，首先去拉镜像，最新版拉取命令</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker pull whyour/qinglong:latest<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/ea954a6947fd4ed79b35a4a04a326d28.png#pic_center"></p><p>安装青龙容器</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker run -dit \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/config:/ql/config \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/log:/ql/log \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/db:/ql/db \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/repo:/ql/repo \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/raw:/ql/raw \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/scripts:/ql/scripts \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/jbot:/ql/jbot \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/deps:/ql/deps \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/ninja:/ql/ninja \<br>  -p 5700:5700 \<br>  -p 5701:5701 \<br>  --name qinglong \<br>  --hostname qinglong \<br>  --restart unless-stopped \<br>  whyour/qinglong:latest<br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/0c6408b2d53447a4bf4f269fd879e633.png#pic_center"></p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/dfd5e273c02a4296bb225dc309e46be1.png#pic_center"><br>出现这一行就是安装完成了</p><p>也可以下载镜像上传安装，打开宝塔面板 Docker 管理器上传下载好的镜像，上传完成后点导入</p><p><strong><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1duc4pQ_r9EdyIh7HHDtazA?pwd=3x2o">青龙2.10.13版本镜像</a></strong></p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/f6691017c7d14962afe95f40dba91925.png#pic_center"></p><p>导入完成后复制以下命令安装容器</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker run -dit \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/config:/ql/config \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/log:/ql/log \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/db:/ql/db \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/repo:/ql/repo \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/raw:/ql/raw \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/scripts:/ql/scripts \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/jbot:/ql/jbot \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/deps:/ql/deps \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/ninja:/ql/ninja \<br>  -p 12010:5700 \<br>  -p 5701:5701 \<br>  --name qinglong \<br>  --hostname qinglong \<br>  --restart unless-stopped \<br>  whyour/qinglong:2.10.13<br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>其中2.10.13是青龙版本号，要拉取其他版本命令如下</p><p>青龙2.10.2镜像</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker pull byniht/qinglong:2.10.2<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装容器</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker run -dit \<br>   -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/config:/ql/config \<br>   -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/log:/ql/log \<br>   -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/db:/ql/db \<br>   -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/repo:/ql/repo \<br>   -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/raw:/ql/raw \<br>   -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/scripts:/ql/scripts \<br>   -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/jbot:/ql/jbot \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/deps:/ql/deps \<br>  -v <span class="hljs-variable">$PWD</span>/ql/ninja:/ql/ninja \<br>   -p 12010:5700 \<br>   -p 5701:5701 \<br>   --name qinglong \<br>   --hostname qinglong \<br>   --restart unless-stopped \<br>   byniht/qinglong:2.10.2<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>6，青龙注册与登录</strong></p><p>创建完成后，去浏览器输入你的青龙所在服务器的IP:和你设置的端口，例如本教程青龙端口是12010，那就访问青龙的 ip:12010.（推荐谷歌浏览器）<br><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/f1108747a3ea4bb68149841d998c4c7a.png#pic_center"><br><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/7e27625ef4064413b389584ceabf9524.png#pic_center"><br><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/ece259c5df83498f83081843b6e037d4.png#pic_center"><br><strong>7，安装依赖</strong></p><p>一键安装</p><p>进入青龙容器，qinglong 代表你的容器名称</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker <span class="hljs-built_in">exec</span> -it qinglong bash<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>一键安装命令(要等许久建议喝几杯茶先)</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">curl -fsSL https://ghproxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shufflewzc/QLDependency/main/Shell/QLOneKeyDependency.sh | sh<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/fcb3fdd383bf4c5385c413385090b88e.png#pic_center"><br>完成后重启青龙容器<br>先退出</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重启青龙容器</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker restart qinglong<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/1c63ccea206a4f7e9c6c4a6451cd1d5c.png#pic_center"></p><p><strong>青龙内安装依赖</strong></p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/97f78b00ff924bedb08b192d395347b4.png#pic_center"><br>添加下面的到图中所示的 node.js 内，按照图来选择！</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npm&amp;upgrade pip&amp;install&amp;png-js&amp;date-fns&amp;axios&amp;crypto-js&amp;ts-md5&amp;tslib&amp;@types/node&amp;dotenv&amp;typescript@&amp;socks-proxy-agent&amp;https-proxy-agent&amp;fs&amp;require&amp;tslib&amp;jsdom&amp;request&amp;js-base64&amp;requests&amp;form-data&amp;crypto -g&amp;ws@7.4.3&amp;prettytable&amp;tough-cookie&amp;jsdom -g&amp;jieba&amp;json5&amp;global-agent&amp;pip3 install jieba&amp;npm i<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/a5786023d56a4ca9882d7356dd94c9d6.png#pic_center"><br>python3内安装以下</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">typescript&amp;requests&amp;canvas&amp;ping3&amp;jieba&amp;PyExecJS<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/ef4cc2830ff34a7886d3fae761faedbd.png#pic_center"><br>linux内安装以下</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">bizCode&amp;bizMsg&amp;lxml<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/c1060db8741f48e789e56023a549f2b4.png#pic_center"><br>等几分钟刷新查看是否成功<br><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/6649969b45814e67a3f2f6d2b5aa07e2.png#pic_center"><br><strong>8，青龙部分命令</strong></p><p>查看青龙密码，注意你的容器及文件夹名称</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> ~ &amp;&amp; <span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> ql/config/auth.json<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>检测青龙环境并修复</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">ql check<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重置登录错误次数，如果是docker容器执行先执行</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">docker <span class="hljs-built_in">exec</span> -it qinglong bash<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>再执行下面命令即可</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">ql resetlet<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>青龙面板的完整安装教程就到这里了，交流群 ：<a href="https://jq.qq.com/?_wv=1027&k=Rvh2OGC8">470779590</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
